    title: "俄羅斯籍勒索軟體嫌犯在日本被捕，涉嫌參與 Qilin 組織入侵德國企業",
    summary: "日本警方於 10 月 8 日宣布，一名涉嫌參與勒索軟體組織 Qilin 的俄羅斯籍嫌犯，於今年 5 月在日本大阪被拘留。日本司法機關已於 10 月 2 日將其引渡至德國。該名 28 歲男子被指控於 2024 年 9 月入侵德國一家物流企業，並加密系統資料，勒索價值超過 16 萬美元的加密貨幣。\nQilin（又稱 Agenda）自 2022 年活躍以來，採用勒索軟體即服務（RaaS）模式，由核心成員提供惡意程式及基礎設施，由附屬攻擊者負責入侵與勒索。該組織的攻擊活動在 2025 年年中達到高峰，曾攻擊朝日啤酒和日產汽車旗下設計公司 CBI 等企業。此外，Qilin 也曾與 Palo Alto Networks VPN 漏洞的入侵消息相關聯，並將美國槍砲監管機構 ATF 列入資料外洩網站，但 ATF 未確認相關性。",
    tags: ["Qilin", "勒索軟體", "RaaS", "俄羅斯籍嫌犯", "德國", "日本"],
    title_en: "Russian Ransomware Suspect Arrested in Japan, Allegedly Involved in Qilin Group's Attack on German Company",
    summary_en: "Japanese police announced on October 8 that a Russian suspect, allegedly involved with the ransomware group Qilin, was detained in Osaka, Japan, in May of this year. Japanese judicial authorities extradited him to Germany on October 2. The 28-year-old man is accused of infiltrating a German logistics company in September 2024 and encrypting system data, demanding a ransom exceeding $160,000 in cryptocurrency.\n\nQilin (also known as Agenda) has operated since 2022, adopting a Ransomware-as-a-Service (RaaS) model, where core members provide malicious code and infrastructure, and affiliated attackers handle the infiltration and extortion. The group's attack activities peaked in mid-2025, targeting companies such as Asahi Beer and CBI, the design subsidiary of Nissan Motor. Furthermore, Qilin has been linked to the intrusion involving a Palo Alto Networks VPN vulnerability and listed the U.S. Bureau of Alcohol, Tobacco, Firearms and Explosives (ATF) on a data leak website, though the ATF has not confirmed any connection.",
    tags_en: ["Qilin", "Ransomware", "RaaS", "Russian Suspect", "Germany", "Japan"],
    sources: [
      { name: "iThome", url: "https://ithome.com.tw/news/179573", lang: "ZH-TW" }
    ]
