    category: "Linux",
    title: "Debian 發布安全公告：修補 DSA 函式庫中的記憶體寫入漏洞",
    summary: "Debian 安全團隊發布安全公告，修補了 DSA 函式庫中的一個記憶體寫入漏洞。此漏洞可能允許遠端攻擊者在未經授權的情況下執行程式碼。受影響的元件為 DSA 函式庫，屬於核心系統元件。修補建議是立即升級 Debian 系統，以確保系統能獲得最新的安全補丁。由於原文未提供具體的 CVSS 分數、受影響版本範圍或影響台數，相關資訊皆為「未公開」。此類漏洞通常透過網路服務或本地執行程式碼觸發，建議系統管理員應及時更新系統以降低風險。",
    tags: ["Debian", "DSA", "記憶體寫入", "安全公告", "Linux 核心元件"],
    title_en: "Debian Issues Security Advisory: Patching Memory Write Vulnerability in DSA Library",
    summary_en: "The Debian security team has issued a security advisory addressing a memory write vulnerability found in the DSA library. This vulnerability could potentially allow a remote attacker to execute unauthorized code. The affected component is the DSA library, which is considered a core system component. The recommended remediation is to immediately upgrade Debian systems to ensure the installation of the latest security patches. As the original text did not provide specific CVSS scores, affected version ranges, or the number of affected installations, this information is listed as 'Not Publicly Available.' Such vulnerabilities are typically triggered through network services or local code execution, and system administrators are advised to update their systems promptly to mitigate risk.",
    tags_en: ["Debian", "DSA", "Memory Write", "Security Advisory", "Linux Kernel Component"],
