    summary: "LineageOS 24 已正式發布，這是為紀念該客製化 ROM 專案成立十週年而推出的重大版本。本版本基於 Android 17，並帶來了大量介面與功能上的升級。主要的更新包括核心應用程式全面採用 Material Design 3 Expressive 設計，新增了名為 Canvas 的內建影像編輯器，用於處理裁切、白平衡和濾鏡等功能。此外，更新器（Updater）支援串流更新，大幅縮短了 A/B 設備的安裝時間。在使用者體驗方面，預設瀏覽器 Jelly 現在支援使用新快捷鍵的 PWA 應用程式，提升了應用安裝的便利性。對於刷機流程的簡化，團隊推出了基於 WebUSB 的刷機工具，可直接透過瀏覽器執行 ADB Fastboot、Amlogic Burn 和 Samsung Odin 等常見安裝流程，讓非專業使用者也能更輕鬆地進行 ROM 安裝。從維護角度，LineageOS 決定限制未來版本對使用 Linux Kernel 4.4 和 4.9 的舊設備支援，但這些舊核心仍將在 LineageOS 22.2 上持續接收每月安全補丁。",
    tags: ["LineageOS 24", "Android 17", "Material Design 3", "WebUSB", "客製化 ROM", "Linux Kernel"],
    title_en: "LineageOS 24 Officially Released, Featuring Android 17, Enhanced Material Design 3 Interface, and WebUSB Flashing Tool",
    summary_en: "LineageOS 24 has been officially released, marking a major version update to commemorate the tenth anniversary of the custom ROM project. This version is based on Android 17 and introduces numerous interface and feature upgrades. Key updates include core applications adopting the Material Design 3 Expressive design, and the addition of a built-in image editor called Canvas, which handles functions such as cropping, white balance, and filters. Furthermore, the Updater now supports streamed updates, significantly reducing installation time for A/B devices. In terms of user experience, the default browser, Jelly, now supports PWA applications using new shortcuts, improving the convenience of application installation. To simplify the flashing process, the team has introduced a WebUSB-based flashing tool that can execute common installation procedures—such as ADB Fastboot, Amlogic Burn, and Samsung Odin—directly through a browser, making ROM installation easier for non-professional users. From a maintenance perspective, LineageOS has decided to limit future version support for older devices using Linux Kernel 4.4 and 4.9, though these older kernels will continue to receive monthly security patches on LineageOS 22.2.",
