    id: "20261012-15677",
    trackers: ["os"],
    category: "重點關注",
    title: "Apple TV推出新原創Podcast《Heart》，探究器官移植與雙重死亡的懸疑真相",
    summary: "Apple TV宣布推出原創真實犯罪Podcast《Heart》，共八集，將於10月19日首播。該Podcast由Karen Kilgariff主持，內容圍繞兩位因一顆捐贈心臟而連結的男性，以及他們共同的悲劇結局。故事核心是：當Sonny Graham接受了救命的心臟移植後，他愛上了捐贈者Terry Cottle的遺孀。原本被地方報紙譽為奇蹟愛情故事的結局，卻在Sonny身亡後發生了悲劇轉折——他的死因與心臟捐贈者Terry Cottle的死因相同，官方結論皆為自殺。Podcast透過彙整法院文件、公共記錄和第一手證詞，深入調查兩人的死亡情境，並質疑移植的心臟是否可能攜帶了捐贈者創傷的痕跡。Apple TV訂閱用戶將於10月19日一次性觀看所有八集，非訂閱用戶則可於當日觀看前三集，之後每週一持續釋出，直到11月23日。Apple TV目前每月收費$14.99，或包含在Apple One套裝服務中。",
    tags: ["Apple TV", "Podcast", "Heart", "真實犯罪", "器官移植", "Apple One"],
    title_en: "Apple TV launches original podcast 'Heart,' exploring the mystery of organ transplantation and double death",
    summary_en: "Apple TV has announced the launch of its original true crime podcast, 'Heart,' consisting of eight episodes, premiering on October 19. Hosted by Karen Kilgariff, the podcast centers on two men connected by a donated heart, and their shared tragic fate. The core story revolves around Sonny Graham, who, after receiving a life-saving heart transplant, falls in love with the widow of the donor, Terry Cottle. What was initially hailed by local papers as a miracle love story takes a tragic turn after Sonny's death—his cause of death is the same as that of the heart donor, Terry Cottle, with official conclusions pointing to suicide. The podcast delves into the circumstances of both men's deaths by compiling court documents, public records, and firsthand testimonies, questioning whether the transplanted heart might carry traces of the donor's trauma. Apple TV subscribers will have access to all eight episodes on October 19, while non-subscribers can watch the first three episodes that day, with subsequent episodes released weekly until November 23. Apple TV currently costs $14.99 per month, or can be included in the Apple One bundle.",
