    category: "重點關注",
    title: "Googlebook 推出 Linux 終端機預覽版，強化 AI 代理開發與系統隔離能力",
    summary: "Googlebook 宣布推出 Linux 終端機（Terminal）預覽版，旨在為使用者提供一個強大的命令列介面，特別適用於 AI 代理（AI agents）的開發與工作流程。此功能允許使用者在隔離的 Linux 虛擬機（VM）環境中執行各種命令，如安裝套件、寫入檔案和自動化任務。為了確保系統安全，Googlebook OS 採用了深度防禦（defense-in-depth）原則，所有終端機指令都在 VM 內運行，有效保護主機作業系統和私人檔案。使用者需明確授權才能將目錄掛載到 Linux VM，且支援一鍵重置 VM，同時保留主機檔案系統上的資料。該 Linux 環境基於 Debian，提供 `apt`、`git`、`ssh` 等成熟的開發工具，並支援 Node.js、Python、Ruby、Go、Rust 等現代運行時。未來規劃包含支援 Linux GUI 應用、USB/ADB 過傳輸、動態記憶體與儲存擴展，以及 GPU/NPU 硬體加速，以滿足更複雜的本地工作負載。",
    tags: ["Googlebook", "Linux VM", "AI agents", "Debian", "終端機", "系統隔離"],
    title_en: "Googlebook Launches Linux Terminal Preview, Enhancing AI Agent Development and System Isolation",
    summary_en: "Googlebook has announced the release of a Linux Terminal preview, designed to provide users with a powerful command-line interface, particularly suited for the development and workflow of AI agents. This feature allows users to execute various commands, such as installing packages, writing files, and automating tasks, within an isolated Linux Virtual Machine (VM) environment. To ensure system security, Googlebook OS adopts a defense-in-depth principle; all terminal commands run inside the VM, effectively protecting the host operating system and private files. Users must explicitly authorize mounting a directory to the Linux VM, and the system supports one-click VM reset while preserving data on the host file system. The Linux environment is based on Debian, offering mature development tools like `apt`, `git`, and `ssh`, and supporting modern runtimes such as Node.js, Python, Ruby, Go, and Rust. Future plans include supporting Linux GUI applications, USB/ADB pass-through, dynamic memory and storage expansion, and GPU/NPU hardware acceleration to meet more complex local workloads.",
    tags_en: ["Googlebook", "Linux VM", "AI agents", "Debian", "Terminal", "System Isolation"],
    sources: [
      { name: "Android Developers Blog", url: "https://android-developers.googleblog.com/2026/10/googlebook-linux-terminal-preview-vm.html", lang: "EN" }
    ]
