    title_en: "Haunted Game P.T. PC Port: Open-Source Tool Recreates PS4 Horror Classic Experience",
    summary_en: "P.T. is a classic playable demo created by renowned game designer Hideo Kojima for the canceled project, *Silent Hills*. Historically, players needed a PS4 console and had to download the content during the game's release period to play it. Now, a programmer known as Lorean Xavier has initiated an open-source porting project aimed at reconstructing *P.T.* into a PC executable. This project utilizes C++ and Vulkan technology, rebuilding every level, model, material, sound effect, script, and cutscene of the game based on the original PS4 game files. This allows the port to surpass the realism of previous emulation attempts. In addition to the core game content, the PC port also includes upscaling, frame-generation, photography mode, experimental third-person and VR support, and a",
