    category: "重點關注",
    title: "AMD於OCP峰會發表Helion AI機架，提供專為AI代理執行與推理優化的解決方案",
    summary: "AMD在2026年Open Compute Project (OCP) 峰會上，發表了名為Helion的機架級AI系統設計。該系統旨在為AI代理（agentic AI）基礎設施提供符合OCP標準的藍圖。與AMD先前用於前沿AI訓練和大規模推論的Helios系統不同，Helion的企業配置將代理執行和推理功能整合於單一機架內。客戶可選擇CPU專用超大規模配置，或結合CPU和GPU的企業配置。該系統可配置高達32,768個Zen 6 CPU核心，透過搭載256核心的Venice Epyc處理器，並可整合多達16個Instinct MI350P GPU加速器，以及高達102 Tbps的網路頻寬。AMD強調，由於AI代理工作負載複雜且多樣，Helion提供彈性、高效能的CPU和GPU配置，讓合作夥伴能根據客戶需求建構系統。AMD計劃將Helion規格貢獻給OCP社群，預計合作夥伴建構的Helion配置將於2026年11月推出。",
    tags: ["AMD", "Helion", "OCP", "AI代理", "Zen 6", "Epyc", "MI350P"],
    title_en: "AMD Unveils Helion AI Chassis at OCP Summit, Offering Solution Optimized for AI Agent Execution and Inference",
    summary_en: "At the 2026 Open Compute Project (OCP) Summit, AMD unveiled a rack-scale AI system design named Helion. This system is designed to provide an OCP-compliant blueprint for AI agentic infrastructure. Unlike AMD's previous Helios system, which was used for advanced AI training and large-scale inference, Helion's enterprise configuration integrates agent execution and inference capabilities within a single rack. Customers can choose between a CPU-dedicated hyperscale configuration or an enterprise configuration combining CPU and GPU. The system can be configured with up to 32,768 Zen 6 CPU cores, utilizing the 256-core Venice Epyc processor, and can integrate up to 16 Instinct MI350P GPU accelerators, along with up to 102 Tbps of network bandwidth. AMD emphasized that because AI agent workloads are complex and diverse, Helion provides flexible and high-performance CPU and GPU configurations, allowing partners to build systems tailored to customer needs. AMD plans to contribute the Helion specifications to the OCP community, with the expected launch of partner-built Helion configurations scheduled for November 2026.",
    tags_en: ["AMD", "Helion", "OCP", "AI Agent", "Zen 6", "Epyc", "MI350P"],
    sources: [
      { name: "The Register", url: "https://theregister.com/systems/2026/10/12/amd-unveils-helion-racks-for-ai-agents-at-ocp-summit/5302652", lang: "EN" }
    ]
