    title: "烏克蘭無人機空襲俄羅斯Yandex資料中心，導致雲端服務與支付系統大規模中斷",
    summary: "由於烏克蘭發動無人機空襲，俄羅斯科技公司 Yandex 的五個資料中心中，三個地點（Sasovo、Kaluga 和 Vladimir）遭到嚴重攻擊，導致其雲端平台 Yandex Cloud 和數位支付服務 Yandex Pay 經歷了大規模的服務中斷。Yandex 工程師持續進行修復工作，但服務恢復進度緩慢，許多核心功能仍無法正常使用。公司表示，雖然服務不可用，但用戶資金是安全的。此次事件造成了多重連鎖影響，包括公共交通資訊系統的故障。Yandex 建議客戶考慮使用替代的託管網站和資源，並持續關注官方狀態頁面以獲取最新資訊。",
    tags: ["Yandex", "Yandex Cloud", "Yandex Pay", "資料中心", "烏克蘭", "俄羅斯"],
    title_en: "Ukrainian Drone Strikes Hit Russian Yandex Data Center, Causing Massive Cloud and Payment System Outages",
    summary_en: "Following a drone strike launched from Ukraine, three of the five data centers belonging to Russian tech company Yandex—located in Sasovo, Kaluga, and Vladimir—were severely attacked. This resulted in massive service disruptions for its cloud platform, Yandex Cloud, and digital payment service, Yandex Pay. Yandex engineers are continuing repair efforts, but service restoration is slow, and many core functionalities remain unavailable. The company stated that although services are unavailable, user funds are safe. The incident caused multiple cascading effects, including the failure of public transport information systems. Yandex advises customers to consider alternative hosting sites and resources, and to monitor the official status page for the latest information.",
